[14.9813, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[21B\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mThis is a public terminal demo of independent Codex discussion forks. The topics are generic software design: CLI command simplification, runtime state simplification,   \u001b[29;1H  and web cache simplification. There is no repository to inspect. Use English. Do not use tools or read any files or memories. Reply exactly: Ready to discuss three       \u001b[30;1H  independent design topics.\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[33;1H\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mReady to discuss three independent design topics.\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[35;1H  Worked for 5s \u2022 14:01                                                                                                                                                     \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[38;1H\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: CLI surface.\u001b[K\r\n  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions. Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks you \u001b[40;1H  to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[42;1H  When the human is ready to finish, they c"]
