[21.3144, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[27;1H\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mThis is a public terminal demo of independent Codex discussion forks. The topics \u2026 \u001b[2m\r\n\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mReady to discuss three independent design topics.\u001b[34X\u001b[29;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n  Worked for 5s \u2022 14:01                                                              \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[31;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\r\n\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: Runtime flow.\u001b[23X\r\n  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions. \r\n  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks \r\n  you to implement changes.\u001b[58X\u001b[37;85H\u001b[1K\r\n  When the human is ready to finish, they can type /finish on its own in this pane.  \r\n  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[16X\u001b[40;85H\u001b[1K\r\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[53X\r\n  In English, suggest two ways to simplify runtime lifecycle states. Start your      \r\n  answer with Runtime:. Max 30 words. Do not use tools.\u001b[30X\u001b[44;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n\u2022 \u001b[2mStarting MCP se"]
